data: {"id": "a491af1b55b44aa7-thinking-parallel_evidence-903", "run_id": "a491af1b55b44aa7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口：\n\n### 已确认事实\n- **身份与拓扑**：Pod `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` (UID: `52361280...`) 运行于 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.15`。\n- **运行状态 (kubectl describe)**：Pod 当前处于 `Running` 状态，Reason 显示为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。存在 `Back-off restarting failed container app` 警告 (x10 over 3m9s)，说明容器经历了连续的启动-崩溃循环。\n- **事件证据 (kubectl events)**：确认了上述 `BackOff` 警告，表明 kubelet 正在重试重启失败的 `app` 容器。\n- **应用日志 (kubectl logs & previous_logs)**：\n  - 当前与上一轮崩溃周期的日志中，均包含明确的 `CONFIG_MISSING` (Level: error) 错误。\n  - 每次崩溃前，应用均尝试处理", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788444177160, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

